   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for general operating support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through a participatory feminist grantmaking model, FRIDA (The Young Feminist Fund) plays a critical role in resourcing emerging feminist initiatives led by girls, young women, and trans and intersex youth. FRIDA provides core support and other forms of flexible funding and accompaniment to young feminist movements and young feminist-led organizations so that they may continue to blossom. FRIDA will continue moving closer to its interconnected visions and serving as a catalyst to transform traditional philanthropic practices. (Strategy: Gender Equity and Governance)</narrative>
  </description>
